<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, minimum-scale=1">
<title>SPIDEY — Anti-nuke and automod for Discord</title>
<meta name="description" content="Spidey stops raids, mass bans and channel wipes in real time, and runs automod, tickets and music from one dashboard.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,600;12..96,800&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #08060a; --ink2: #0f0c12; --panel: #130f16; --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
    --red: #ff3b4e; --red-soft: #ff8a96; --ice: #8fd8ff; --ok: #3ddc84;
    --text: #f5f1f3; --muted: #a79fa6;
    --display: 'Bricolage Grotesque', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --body: 'DM Sans', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-family: var(--body); line-height: 1.55; min-height: 100vh;
    background: radial-gradient(900px 520px at 8% -8%, rgba(255,59,78,0.20), transparent 60%), var(--ink);
  }
  a { color: inherit; }
  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ice); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 6px; }
  .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  /* Nav */
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 18px 24px; max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 19px; text-decoration: none; }
  .brand-logo { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 26px; }
  .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); transition: color .15s; }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: transform .15s, background .15s, border-color .15s; }
  .btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--red); color: #1a0306; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #ff5566; }
  .nav-links a.btn-primary { color: #1a0306; }
  .btn-ghost { border-color: var(--line); color: var(--text); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); }
  .hamburger { display: none; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); color: var(--text); font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer; }

  /* Drawer */
  .drawer-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); z-index: 30; }
  .drawer { position: fixed; top: 0; right: 0; height: 100%; width: min(270px, 86vw); z-index: 40; visibility: hidden; background: var(--ink2); border-left: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 22px 20px; transform: translateX(100%); transition: transform .25s ease, visibility 0s linear .25s; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .drawer.open { transform: translateX(0); visibility: visible; transition: transform .25s ease, visibility 0s; }
  .drawer-overlay.open { display: block; }
  .drawer a { text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .drawer .btn { margin-top: 16px; border: none; }
  .drawer-close { align-self: flex-end; background: none; border: none; color: var(--text); font-size: 22px; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .drawer details.drawer-group { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .drawer details.drawer-group summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 13px 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-start; text-align: left; }
  .drawer details.drawer-group .grp-chev { transition: transform .15s ease; margin-left: auto; }
  .drawer details.drawer-group[open] .grp-chev { transform: rotate(180deg); }
  .drawer details.drawer-group summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .drawer > a { display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .drawer details.drawer-group[open] summary { color: var(--text); }
  .drawer details.drawer-group .sub { margin: 2px 0 12px 15px; padding-left: 12px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  .drawer details.drawer-group .sub a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; border-bottom: none; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 9px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; transition: background .15s, color .15s; }
  .drawer details.drawer-group .sub a svg { margin-right: 0 !important; opacity: .85; }
  .drawer details.drawer-group .sub a:hover, .drawer details.drawer-group .sub a:active { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: var(--text); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .nav-links { display: none; } .hamburger { display: block; } }

  /* Hero */
  .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; padding: 64px 0 40px; }
  .status-line { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .dot { position: relative; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ok); box-shadow: 0 0 8px 1px rgba(61,220,132,0.7); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .dot::before, .dot::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ok); animation: livePing 2s cubic-bezier(0,0,.2,1) infinite; }
  .dot::after { animation-delay: 1s; }
  @keyframes livePing { 0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: .6; } 80%, 100% { transform: scale(3.4); opacity: 0; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .dot::before, .dot::after { animation: none; opacity: 0; } }
  h1 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(36px, 5.4vw, 60px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .lead { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; max-width: 46ch; margin: 0 0 30px; }
  .cta-row { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  /* Live protection log — the one memorable thing on the page */
  .log { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px rgba(255,59,78,0.35); }
  .log-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 13px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
  .log-head span { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; }
  .log-body { padding: 8px 0; height: 316px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .log-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 54px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); animation: logIn .4s ease both; }
  .log-row:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .log-row time { color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 12px; }
  .tag { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tag.block { background: rgba(255,59,78,0.14); color: var(--red-soft); }
  .tag.undo { background: rgba(143,216,255,0.14); color: var(--ice); }
  .tag.ok { background: rgba(61,220,132,0.14); color: var(--ok); }
  @keyframes logIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

  /* Live numbers */
  .numbers { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); margin: 24px 0 0; }
  .num { padding: 22px 8px 22px 0; }
  .num + .num { padding-left: 24px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .num b { display: block; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .num span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }

  /* Sections */
  section { padding: 84px 0 0; }
  h2 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 40px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 800; }
  .section-lead { color: var(--muted); max-width: 52ch; margin: 0 0 36px; }

  /* Features: one anchor feature + a quiet list */
  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  .anchor { background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1d0a10, var(--panel)); border: 1px solid rgba(255,59,78,0.28); border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px; }
  .anchor h3 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 24px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .anchor p { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 20px; }
  .anchor ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px 18px; font-size: 14px; }
  .anchor li::before { content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--red); margin-right: 10px; vertical-align: middle; }
  .list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .item { padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .item:first-child { border-top: none; padding-top: 4px; }
  .item h3 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; }
  .item p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }

  /* Premium */
  .premium { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: center; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; padding: 38px; }
  .price { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 44px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .price small { font-family: var(--body); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0; }
  .perks { list-style: none; margin: 18px 0 26px; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; }
  .perks li::before { content: "✓"; color: var(--ok); font-weight: 800; margin-right: 10px; }
  .profile { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--ink2); max-width: 340px; width: 100%; justify-self: center; }
  .profile .banner { height: 96px; background: linear-gradient(120deg, #ff3b4e, #5b1530 55%, #17324a); }
  .profile .av { width: 68px; height: 68px; border-radius: 50%; border: 4px solid var(--ink2); margin: -34px 0 0 18px; object-fit: cover; display: block; background: var(--panel); }
  .profile .who { padding: 10px 18px 20px; }
  .profile .who b { font-size: 17px; }
  .profile .who p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; }


  /* Starry night sky behind the hero */
  html { overflow-x: hidden; }
  body { position: relative; overflow-x: hidden; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #030208 0, #07050c 700px, var(--ink) 1100px); }
  nav, main, footer { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .sky { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 900px; overflow: hidden; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(#000 55%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(#000 55%, transparent 100%); }
  .sky::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(700px 360px at 85% 8%, rgba(60,70,140,0.22), transparent 70%), radial-gradient(600px 300px at 10% 0%, rgba(255,59,78,0.10), transparent 70%); }
  .star { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; opacity: .8; animation: twinkle var(--d, 4s) ease-in-out var(--l, 0s) infinite; }
  .star.warm { background: #ffc9cf; }
  @keyframes twinkle { 0%, 100% { opacity: .15; transform: scale(.8); } 50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.25); } }
  /* Cloud band: pops out over the bottom of the price card, rises in and drifts as you scroll */
  .cloud-band { position: relative; z-index: 3; width: 100vw; margin: -64px 0 -70px calc(50% - 50vw); height: 330px; pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(90px) scale(.98); transition: transform 1.2s cubic-bezier(.16,.84,.24,1), opacity .9s ease; }
  .cloud-band.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .cloud-band svg { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; transform: translate3d(0, var(--cp, 0px), 0); will-change: transform; }
  .cloud-band .c1 { opacity: .95; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .cloud-band { height: 250px; margin-top: -98px; margin-bottom: -6px; } }

  /* Price comparison */
  .compare { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; padding: 10px 26px 84px; max-width: 860px; }
  .cmp-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 210px 1fr 96px; gap: 16px; align-items: center; padding: 18px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .cmp-row:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .cmp-name { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.3; }
  .cmp-ic { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 9px; background: var(--ink2); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .cmp-ic img { width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: cover; }
  .cmp-track { height: 16px; border-radius: 5px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
  .cmp-bar { display: block; height: 100%; width: var(--w); border-radius: 5px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,59,78,0.12), var(--red)); transform-origin: left; }
  .cmp-row.ours .cmp-bar { background: var(--ice); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(143,216,255,0.65); }
  .cmp-row.ours .cmp-name { font-weight: 700; }
  .cmp-price { text-align: right; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .cmp-price small { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; font-size: 12px; }
  .cmp-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  .js-anim .cmp-bar { transform: scaleX(0); }
  .js-anim.in .cmp-bar { transform: none; transition: transform .9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }
  .js-anim.in .cmp-row:nth-child(2) .cmp-bar { transition-delay: .12s; }
  .js-anim.in .cmp-row:nth-child(3) .cmp-bar { transition-delay: .24s; }
  .js-anim.in .cmp-row:nth-child(4) .cmp-bar { transition-delay: .36s; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .compare { padding: 6px 16px; }
    .cmp-row { grid-template-columns: 112px 1fr 80px; gap: 10px; }
    .cmp-name { font-size: 13px; gap: 8px; } .cmp-ic { width: 28px; height: 28px; font-size: 14px; }
  }

  .pop { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px) scale(.95); transition: opacity .55s ease, transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1.1); }
  .pop.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  footer { margin-top: 90px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 28px 0 40px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; }
  footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  footer .wrap > div:last-child { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 18px; }
  footer a { text-decoration: none; margin-left: 0; }
  footer a:hover { color: var(--text); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero, .features, .premium { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .hero > *, .features > *, .premium > * { min-width: 0; }
    .hero { padding-top: 36px; gap: 36px; }
    .numbers { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .num:nth-child(3) { padding-left: 0; border-left: none; }
    .num:nth-child(n+3) { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .premium { padding: 26px; }
    .log-body { height: 280px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .log-row, .puff { animation: none; } .star { animation: none; opacity: .7; } .cloud-band { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } .cloud-band svg { transform: none; } .js-anim .cmp-bar { transform: none !important; transition: none !important; } html { scroll-behavior: auto; } .pop { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }
  /* Shop icon, top right */
  .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .nav-icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); color: var(--text); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-decoration: none; transition: border-color .15s, color .15s; }
  .nav-icon:hover { border-color: rgba(255,59,78,0.6); color: var(--red-soft); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="sky" id="sky" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <nav>
    <a class="brand" href="/"><img class="brand-logo" src="/logo.png" alt=""> SPIDEY</a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/status">Status</a>
      <a href="/about">About</a>
      <a href="/documentation">Docs</a>
      <a href="/support">Support</a>
      <% if (user) { %><a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">Open dashboard</a>
      <% } else { %><a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">Log in with Discord</a><% } %>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-actions"><a class="nav-icon" href="/shop" aria-label="Shop" title="Shop"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z"/><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg></a><button class="hamburger" aria-label="Open menu" onclick="toggleDrawer(true)">☰</button></div>
  </nav>

  <div class="drawer-overlay" id="overlay" onclick="toggleDrawer(false)"></div>
  <div class="drawer" id="drawer">
    <button class="drawer-close" aria-label="Close menu" onclick="toggleDrawer(false)">✕</button>
    <a href="/"><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;flex-shrink:0;"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>Home</a>
    <a href="/dashboard"><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;flex-shrink:0;"><rect width="7" height="9" x="3" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="5" x="14" y="3" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="9" x="14" y="12" rx="1"/><rect width="7" height="5" x="3" y="16" rx="1"/></svg>Dashboard</a>
    <details class="drawer-group">
      <summary><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;flex-shrink:0;"><path d="m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z"/><path d="m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65"/><path d="m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65"/></svg>Extra <span class="grp-chev">⌄</span></summary>
      <div class="sub">
      <a href="/status"><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;flex-shrink:0;"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>Status</a>
      <a href="/about"><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;flex-shrink:0;"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>About</a>
      <a href="/documentation"><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;flex-shrink:0;"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>Documentation</a>
    </div>
    </details>
    <a href="/support"><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;flex-shrink:0;"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"/></svg>Support</a>
    <a href="/shop"><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:6px;flex-shrink:0;"><path d="M6 3h12l4 6-10 13L2 9Z"/><path d="M11 3 8 9l4 13 4-13-3-6"/><path d="M2 9h20"/></svg>Premium</a>
    <% if (user) { %><a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">Open dashboard</a>
    <% } else { %><a href="/login" class="btn btn-primary">Log in with Discord</a><% } %>
  </div>

  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="status-line"><span class="dot"></span> <%= botTag %> is online</div>
        <h1>Raids and nukes get stopped before anyone notices.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Spidey watches your audit log in real time, undoes mass bans and channel wipes, and filters spam. You set it up once from the dashboard.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <% if (user) { %><a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary">Open dashboard</a>
