        <div class="cmp-row"><div class="cmp-name"><span class="cmp-ic"><svg class="i" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:0px;flex-shrink:0;margin:0;vertical-align:middle"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><line x1="19" x2="19" y1="8" y2="14"/><line x1="22" x2="16" y1="11" y2="11"/></svg></span>Welcome and integration handler</div><div class="cmp-track"><i class="cmp-bar" style="--w:80%"></i></div><div class="cmp-price">$4 <small>/ mo</small></div></div>
